{"reviewId": "353616856_88VlriPdZ", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "想象一座山峰：\n从山脚到山顶是上升期（包括“大步上坡”的繁荣和“小步上坡”的衰退），山顶就是衰退结束的点。\n从山顶到下一个山脚是下降期（包括“大步下坡”的萧条和“小步下坡”的回升），山脚就是回升结束的点。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "range": "2032-2121", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "353616856_88VlriPdZ", "userVid": 353616856, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778151017, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 353616856, "name": "x²", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/TKywGoQEbNwtLImOd1GviceBrQrbkGJiagmF29IzPtk75Tw7M4GqzkianLKX9I8tuVt6scSiac1amtTwoupnJicc7JQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 366865503, "name": "心有山海", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/w42gTDypwkiadjITuiaMjDOPBE3hEF6nQNiakrYeOJ0O1qWqo3TlaXcicB2w32a7BGbv3rAtmXL65UnM2hiaibAOibTicQ55sMfBcCOBvdp6e0pjBfU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "这个形容很形象。", "reviewId": "353616856_88VlriPdZ", "commentId